# platform-gitops

Desired state of the platform itself (Layer 2 of the App-of-Apps model).
Seeded and updated by `bootstrapper install-gitops`; reconciled by Argo CD.

- `apps/` — one Argo CD Application per platform service. The root Application
  (`platform-root`, applied by the bootstrapper) syncs this directory.
- `manifests/` — plain-YAML payloads for the non-Helm Applications
  (ClusterIssuer, OIDC RBAC, portal redirect, CI runner).

Do not edit by hand while the bootstrapper CLI is still the source of truth —
change the templates in the Bootstrapper repo and re-run `install-gitops`.

